103
00:04:58,032 --> 00:05:02,204
Every build in this course follows six engineering principles.

104
00:05:02,204 --> 00:05:04,020
Model output is a proposal,

105
00:05:04,020 --> 00:05:07,519
never a fact. Authorization lives outside the model.

106
00:05:07,519 --> 00:05:10,479
A human approves every consequential action.

107
00:05:10,479 --> 00:05:12,767
Decisions and evidence are logged.

108
00:05:12,767 --> 00:05:16,737
The stack stays provider-agnostic. And quality is measured,

109
00:05:16,737 --> 00:05:17,544
not assumed.

110
00:05:18,294 --> 00:05:20,887
Ten modules. Three days, hands-on.

111
00:05:20,887 --> 00:05:24,091
Five common mistakes reproduced and fixed.

112
00:05:24,091 --> 00:05:27,294
And zero applies without a human approval.

